0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:#f45145;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://files.figshare.com/1968071/barometro_enero.RData\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://files.figshare.com/1968071/barometro_enero.RData&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243544556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MIMkboFXv6GbmebsG1RSk\">.Rdat</a> con los datos para que empezeis a jugar directamente en R.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Os convocamos el Martes 14 Abril alas 20:00 en el BuleBar para presentar lo que hemos hecho.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Reglas:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Pasárselo bien y aprender algo nuevo.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Podéis apuntaros de manera individual o en grupo, pero hay que apuntarse <a style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:#f45145;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://doodle.com/sfxw7g3ng2t5fc6i\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://doodle.com/sfxw7g3ng2t5fc6i&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243544556000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0R6PhAkmyG1hYXNIAQ6vxn\">aquí</a> (solo pedimos nombre en un Doodle = 10 segundos) para poder organizar la reunión.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- El punto de partida es la encuesta del CIS, pero se puede usar cualquier información extra que queráis. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Se presentara lo que habéis hecho en 3-5 minutos el día de la Reunión. Se aceptan desde duos cómicos hasta tratados técnicos.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Compartir el código usado con nosotros.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Premios:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><img style=\"min-height:auto;max-width:100%;display:inline;float:left;margin:13.5px 27px 13.5px 0px\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/eO3WfpmspLdthkOFF4VuegBnoJn0K6AyqMvMtmWadsxwBiWxocjWwViagZ7Aqimnw7vhbbYybOGO=s0-d-e1-ft#http://./program/resources/blocked.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"188\">- Para todos los participantes: cerveza pagada durante la reunión.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Mejor visualización: Camiseta &quot;I love R!&quot; o &quot;Bigger than big Data&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Mejor idea de predicción: Camiseta &quot;I love R!&quot; o &quot;Bigger than big Data&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">Jurado.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px 0px 27px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;margin:0px;outline:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">- Premios por decisión popular y a mano alzada en el mismo Bar.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n-- <br>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>Ignasi Bartomeus PhD<br><a href=\"http://www.bartomeuslab.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.co